        "heading": "Google Ads That Actually Drive Sales",
        "sub_heading": "For eComm Brands, Local Businesses & Growth-Ready Stores",
        "text": "<p>You’ve got a great product. But if the right people aren’t seeing it, you’re leaving sales on the table. Google Ads is how we fix that.</p><p>We help Shopify stores get found by high-intent shoppers already searching for what you sell. Our campaigns are built to convert, no fluff, no wasted spend. Just the right clicks from the right buyers.</p><p>Running a service business? Whether you’re an electrician, plumber or builder, Google Ads can keep your phone ringing and your calendar full. You don’t need to chase leads, we’ll bring them to you.</p><p><strong>No templates. No guessing. Just results.</strong></p>",
