        "sub_heading": "Service-based businesses need more than just traffic,  you need real enquiries.",
        "text": "<p>If you’re running a plumbing biz, electrical company, or a local service,  the only clicks that matter are the ones that lead to actual phone calls or quote requests. That’s where we come in.</p><p>We don’t just run Google Ads. We build laser-focused campaigns that make your phone ring with real customers, not tyre kickers. It's not about more impressions or fancy reports. It's about filling your calendar with jobs from people who are ready to pay.</p><p>If your last campaign didn’t deliver leads, it wasn’t the platform’s fault. It’s how it was set up. Let’s fix that.</p>",
