        "heading": "Advertising Solutions for Online Stores",
        "sub_heading": "Targeted ads that drive real sales",
        "text": "<p>When you’re running an online store, every click counts. That’s why we build Google Ads campaigns that don’t just attract traffic – they bring in the right kind of shoppers.</p><p>We help Shopify store owners get found fast, sell more of their hero products, and avoid wasting money on clicks that don’t convert. Whether it’s a niche product or a high-volume bestseller, we tailor campaigns to meet your goals and margins.</p><p>Our team keeps your ads sharp. Adjusting bids, testing copy, and finding pockets of high-intent buyers across Google Search, Shopping, and Display. The result? Better visibility, lower cost per conversion, and steady, scalable growth.</p><p>No fluff, just strategy that gets results.</p>",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/contact",
        "button_text": "Help Grow My Business",
