        "heading": "Google Ads That Bring In The Right Leads",
        "sub_heading": "Stop Chasing Work. Start Booking It.",
        "text": "<p>If you're a service-based business, leads are everything. But not just any leads you want the kind of clients who are ready to pick up the phone and book. That’s where we come in.</p><p>We build Google Ads campaigns that target your ideal customers with pinpoint precision. Whether you're a local plumber, electrician, builder, or pest control expert, we make sure your ads show up exactly when people are searching for the services you offer  not before, not after.</p><p>Every click matters. We set up smart campaigns that turn clicks into calls, forms into bookings, and enquiries into high-paying jobs. From call tracking to suburb-level targeting, we’ve got the strategy that gets your phone buzzing.</p><p>This is lead generation done right, no fluff, no wasted budget, just solid enquiries from customers who need you now.</p><p><strong>Let’s get you booked out.</strong></p>",
