        "heading": "Get More Sales Without Guesswork",
        "sub_heading": "Smart Google Ads Campaigns That Actually Convert",
        "text": "<p>Getting clicks is easy. Turning those clicks into actual orders? That’s where most eComm brands struggle. We don’t just launch campaigns and hope for the best. We build funnels that guide the right shopper all the way from search to checkout.</p><p>We optimise for high-intent traffic, people who are already looking for what you sell. And we track everything: product page views, cart activity, conversion rates, and ROAS. So you’re not just spending, you’re scaling.</p><p>Want more abandoned carts recovered? Higher AOV? We run remarketing ads that pull shoppers back in and product feed campaigns that put your bestsellers in front of buyers who are ready to spend.</p><p>Whether you're trying to grow your customer base or boost LTV, our eCommerce Google Ads strategies are built to do one thing: sell more, profitably.</p><p><strong>Let’s turn browsers into buyers.</strong></p>",
