        "sub_heading": "Smart Targeting. Real Calls. More Booked Jobs.",
        "text": "<p>It’s not just about getting leads,  it’s about getting the right ones. The kind that actually pick up the phone, request a quote, and are ready to go. That’s what a good Google Ads strategy should deliver.</p><p>We track exactly what time of day your audience is most active, what keywords drive action (not just clicks), and which ad copy leads to phone calls. You’ll know what’s working, what needs tweaking, and where your next job is likely to come from.</p><p>Plus, we set up call tracking so you can listen in on lead quality. No fluff metrics, just real conversations with real people looking for your services.</p><p>If you’ve wasted money on ads before, we get it. But with the right setup and constant optimisation, your campaigns don’t just sit there, they do the heavy lifting.</p><p><strong>Let’s make the phone ring for the right reasons.</strong></p>",
